  "scope": "Negative-only two-u32 possible-membership mask in each AVM1 PropertyMap. The exact positive current-key slot hint stays first. Both case modes mark before returning a vacant entry; deletes retain bits, new/default are empty, and clones/moves retain the table and mask together. Only a missing bit can reject an own-table query; possible matches use the original IndexMap, casefold FNV, descriptor and enumeration paths. No prototype/getter/watcher/native-display result, object identity or mutation epoch is cached. Added scalar payload is 8 bytes per map; ObjectData has two maps. Target layout/RSS and unprofiled FPS remain unmeasured, with no qualification or performance claim.",
